  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:</strong> HaoTian Laser is a manufacturer specializing in industrial laser equipment, particularly fiber laser marking machines. We cater to a variety of industries with our laser solutions.<br><br><strong>&bull; Product Description:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"7:3-7:166\" class=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong class=\"\">Fiber Laser Marking Machines:</strong></span><span> Their core product line.</span><span> These machines use concentrated beams of light to permanently mark various materials.</span><span> They are known for:</span></p>\r\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"8:5-12:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"8:5-8:54\"><span>Durability and low maintenance</span><span>.</span></li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"9:5-9:48\"><span>Speed and precision for intricate designs.</span></li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"10:5-10:89\"><span>Ability to work with various metals and some non-metals (plastics,</span><span> wood,</span><span> leather).</span></li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"11:5-12:0\"><span>Different laser powers are available (e.</span><span>g.,</span><span> 20W,</span><span> 50W) to suit project needs.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>CO2 Laser Engraving and Cutting Machines:</strong></span><span> Haotian might also offer CO2 lasers,</span><span> which are another type of laser commonly used for engraving and cutting applications on a wider range of materials compared to fiber lasers (information limited on specific CO2 models offered).&nbsp;<br></span></p>\r\n<p><span>-Homepage: <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><a href=\"https://haotianlaser.store/\" style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">HaoTian Store</a></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>-Products: <a href=\"https://haotianlaser.store/collections/all\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Product Page</strong></span></a></p>",
